# Supabase Client Configuration
# In Stage 1, these can remain empty or placeholder; demo mode runs automatically when values are unconfigured.
# In Stage 2, connect your live Supabase project by copying project URL and anon public key from Supabase Dashboard -> Project Settings -> API.
# WARNING: NEVER put your SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY here. Only public/anon keys are safe for frontend code.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
VITE_APP_NAME="HSB Academic Portal | Hari Shankar Singhania School of Business"
